---
// The Sphinx, in the manner of the Argos figure that follows her: a dark body
// with a blue outline and incised lines, couchant in profile with her wing
// raised, and one lidded eye inside the rings of Byakko's. She asks, and a
// wrong answer does not pass, so she heads the homepage's questions. Drawn
// with no ground of her own, on a flat base.
